"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃花","author":"王恭","text":"蜀鸟啼来口血深，染成花萼满空林。\n芳魂不逐风吹散，还向天涯醉客心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西岩兰若","author":"王恭","text":"白云深处磬声微，祗树林幽映竹扉。\n几度月明禅榻夜，洞?溪鹤也忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄山中友","author":"王恭","text":"一别青山音问稀，白云流水思依依。\n不知老鹤巢边树，几度开花几度飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方壶道人山房二首 其一","author":"王恭","text":"洞门一径入烟霞，九曲溪泉绕洞斜。\n铁笛一声山月冷，独骑黄鹤问仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方壶道人山房二首 其二","author":"王恭","text":"羽人住处是仙源，蔓草藤花掩洞门。\n看罢黄庭人不见，唯馀寒溜与霜?。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张良归山图","author":"王恭","text":"抽却朝簪别汉家，赤松相候在烟霞。\n如今悟得全身计，不似从前博浪沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲二首 其一","author":"王恭","text":"吴姬日暮隔云歌，玉腕罗裙采芰荷。\n画桨浮