:"江亭送别","author":"王恭","text":"绿杨江上把离杯，君去金陵几日回。\n淮岸苍苍吴树远，相思应在凤凰台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蚕妇","author":"王恭","text":"粉黛无心鬓影凉，十年犹著旧衣裳。\n东邻西舍迎鸾日，正是春风陌上桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之京","author":"王恭","text":"送君南浦饮离觞，官柳青青野水香。\n借问风帆何处落，秣陵城下树苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上闻篴","author":"王恭","text":"江上遥闻吹篴声，荻残枫冷最关情。\n断肠况是凉州曲，何异山阳客里行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋城闻雁","author":"王恭","text":"海国凉秋白雁声，行人一骑发边城。\n故乡闻此肠堪断，况复今朝在客情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客舍闻捣衣","author":"王恭","text":"山馆?啼碎客心，恶闻何处响孤砧。\n数声惊觉还家梦，一夜挑灯忆故林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同友人寻梵宇","author":"王恭","text":"清溪一道出寒林，莲宇萧条野树深。\n无数青山看不厌，白云芳草两同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居","author":"王恭","text":"枫林草屋半苍苔，寂寂柴扉映竹开。\n啼鸟数声春自好，五陵年少不曾来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山对酒","author":"王恭","text":"山顶春泉带雨香，数声啼鸟近壶觞。\n遥怜曲水兰亭下，寥落风流野草长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新燕","author":"王恭","text":"海燕双飞下柳塘，主家台榭已荒凉。\n玉窗绣户春云外，不忍翻飞过别墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老僧","author":"王恭","text":"寺前萝径尽荒苔，懒向人间再渡杯。\n阶下双松今百尺，青青曾是少年栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游岩泉寺","author":"王恭","text":"野寺迢迢隐碧岑，曲栏荒殿古苔深。\n可怜一段岩头水，洗尽浮生用世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人回京口军","author":"王恭","text":"扬子江头杨柳花，金山对面是京华。\n行人归醉军城酒，北向青门正熟瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋声","author":"王恭","text":"西风初起雁声微，千里关河叶尽飞。\n借问凄凉何处落，五陵松柏远依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翡翠","author":"王恭","text":"品流曾不让山鸡，珠树林深碧羽齐。\n莫近梁王池上去，野烟寒雨草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠闽山隐者","author":"王恭","text":"隐者閒门映竹溪，白云来往伴幽栖。\n松花正熟山中酒，半亩黄精叶又齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧筒歌","author":"王恭","text":"试折青荷当玉觞，绿茎通处泻琼浆。\n几回醉买西湖月，卧载莲舟梦亦香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭干臣五马山房","author":"王恭","text":"昨夜愁声落汉原，长陵金粟尽啼?。\n谁家风木无穷思，五马山深独闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为高漫士题支离傲世图","author":"王恭","text":"南苑芳菲雨露新，空山寂寞独离尘。\n也知樗散非时用，却倚云林冷笑春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明","author":"王恭","text":"带印何如漉酒閒，五株残柳旧乡关。\n石头城下秋烟冷，正是东篱采菊还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"王恭","text":"逸思由来不受羁，长楸宫外草萋萋。\n流沙路远空回首，宁向龙池影里嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上送别林崇高先辈二首 其二","author":"王恭","text":"朝来候馆唱离歌，客里云山奈别何。\n忽见陌头千树柳，青青那似故情多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登西石岩不与口占","author":"王恭","text":"狂客登山逸兴新，欲同清赏愧无因。\n此身得似同林鸟，飞去飞来不属人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈孟敷寓三衢","author":"王恭","text":"姑篾寒山色似苔，越城霜菊为谁开。\n野藤洞口楼西月，付与何人照酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答林遵性","author":"王恭","text":"君去秋襟谁共开，客庭辜负菊花杯。\n西风野水寒禽外，无那相思倚啸台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题茅斋霜月","author":"王恭","text":"猿断霜空烛影微，半林孤月掩荆扉。\n五陵年少皆缨冕，何事寒山独布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野航风雨图","author":"王恭","text":"枫树萧萧野水西，楚天云雨正凄迷。\n沧江欲暮风潮急，谁汎扁舟更出溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林虚白画商山四皓","author":"王恭","text":"几年云卧得清閒，总被留侯误出山。\n若使汉储非早计，绿萝青壁也何颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为郑浮丘题花鸭","author":"王恭","text":"曲栏斗罢欲离群，还忆吹香几上闻。\n积水天池非不到，野塘寒苇月纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生色拒霜","author":"王恭","text":"綵毫将恨寄清酣，梦落西风濯锦潭。\n却忆故园凉月曙，断英残粉湿秋衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄蜀葵","author":"王恭","text":"芳心曾为太阳倾，云叶离离玉露零。\n想似茂陵仙梦远，柏梁秋雨洒金茎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林良箴所藏文与可墨竹","author":"王恭","text":"兔鹘萧条墨影深，湖州真迹重千金。\n梦回月冷閒堂曙，空翠濛濛上客簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为高漫士题方壶效米小景","author":"王恭","text":"暮云春树意俱閒，鹤上瑶笙去不还。\n梦觉屋梁残月曙，半帘空翠米家山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澹游雨竹","author":"王恭","text":"梦入零陵见旧丘，忽闻瑶瑟不胜愁。\n觉来一片空山雨，散落潇湘万叶秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林彦衡典教英山余以墨竹寄之因题于上","author":"王恭","text":"好是筼筜玉一枝，露寒金薤影离离。\n泮林官冷闲看画，知尔家园落梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书云山小景","author":"王恭","text":"野杖閒行日未曛，商歌休思世人闻。\n生平最是知心物，祗有青山共白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方壶清响生琳琅","author":"王恭","text":"壶丘仙客写琳琅，金薤临风片影凉。\n夜半苍梧飞梦到，冷冷瑶瑟满潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":34963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]